SUMMARY:Movie Night: The Matrix — Bush Week Tech Fest
DESCRIPTION:Wind down day two of Bush Week Tech Fest with our fun\, social screening of The Matrix! We’ve booked out a cinema just for us\, because there’s no better way to finish a day of hacking than with the classic film about one of pop culture’s most famous fictional hackers. \n\nIf you’re up to it\, break out your sunglasses and a black/leather outfit to watch The Matrix in The-Matrix-style 😎 https://anucssa.github.io/techfest-website/events/movie-night/
LOCATION:Level 2\, North Quarter\, Canberra Centre\, 148 Bunda Street\, Canberra ACT 2601
URL:https://anucssa.github.io/techfest-website/events/movie-night/
